        "execSummary":  "Google\u0027s Antigravity Teamwork results show that orchestrated multi-agent systems are now reaching autonomous research-grade output — solving open academic problems and contributing to production open-source code without direct human authorship. For enterprise leaders, this is a leading indicator of where agentic orchestration is heading: teams of specialized AI agents tackling problems too complex or sustained for any single model or human analyst. The implication for knowledge-intensive enterprises — legal, finance, engineering, research — is that multi-agent orchestration platforms will become competitive infrastructure within the next planning cycle. Leaders should begin scoping where sustained, multi-step AI reasoning would create the highest business value and evaluate orchestration readiness in current AI platforms.",
