        "execSummary":  "This capability strengthens enterprise agent security governance by centralizing OAuth consent management through managed infrastructure, enforcing corporate identity authentication while maintaining per-user token isolation critical for compliance and audit requirements. Organizations deploying agents that must access multiple enterprise tools — CRMs, ticketing systems, communication platforms — can now standardize identity and consent handling without building bespoke integration plumbing. CloudTrail integration provides full traceability of consent operations, supporting security monitoring and governance protocols essential for regulated environments. For customer-support leaders, this directly addresses the authorization and accountability gap that has slowed agentic AI adoption in support workflows requiring multi-system access.",
