        "summary":  "NVIDIA announced its acquisition of Hugging Face for approximately $12.9 billion. The acquisition aims to strengthen the open-source AI platform while maintaining its commitment to supporting diverse models, frameworks, and computing platforms. Hugging Face will continue operating as an open platform accessible to its 18 million developers and 200,000+ companies without requiring NVIDIA hardware.",
