        "date":  "2026-09-16",
        "theme":  "Agents",
        "summary":  "As coding agents proliferate, software developers must increasingly manage AI tools in ways that parallel managing human employees — providing clear instructions, guidance, and ongoing oversight. This shift is changing career trajectories in software development, as agent-management skills may become as strategically valuable as traditional technical expertise.",
