        "date":  "2026-09-10",
        "theme":  "Agents",
        "summary":  "Navya Agarwal argues enterprises should prioritize on-site AI agent deployments over browser-based or cloud-hosted alternatives to maintain governance, accountability, and brand control. On-site agents with API integration, instrumentation, and human escalation paths create auditable, policy-governed interfaces rather than uncontrolled autonomous systems operating outside enterprise perimeters.",
